  << /ActualText (HTTP status codes are grouped as follows\072 1xx informational\054 2xx success\054 3xx redirection\054 4xx client error\054 5xx server error\056 Code 402 falls in the 4xx range\054 designated to signal that payment is required to access the requested resource\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
