15549 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The 402 Payment Required status code has been described as \042reserved for future use\042 since it first appeared explicitly in RFC 2068\054 the HTTP\0571\0561 specification\056 Section 15\0565\0563 of RFC 9110 retains essentially the same description\056 Unlike 401 Unauthorized and 403 Forbidden \024 both of which have clearly defined use cases \024 402 has remained without a standardized implementation to this day\056)
