15576 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The answer is that three distinct forces have recently converged on the same point\056\n\nThe first is the industrial maturation of blockchain and smart contracts\056 Through the mid\0552010s\054 blockchain was largely trapped in an image as a vehicle for speculative assets\056 But Ethereum\047s smart contracts made it possible to execute payment\054 settlement\054 and authentication functions through code\054 expanding blockchain from a simple asset\055transfer mechanism into infrastructure capable of storing and running rules\056 The emergence of high\055performance chains \024 Solana\054 and Ethereum layer\0552 networks like Base \024 created an environment where large volumes of payments could be processed at low cost\056 On some of these chains\054 transaction speeds have been compressed to seconds and per\055transaction costs have fallen below one cent\056\n\nThe second force is AI\056 From the backpropagation algorithm of the 1980s3\051 through Yann LeCun\047s convolutional neural network research in 1989\0544\051 the transformer architecture in 2017\0545\051 and the release of ChatGPT in 2022\054 AI established itself as a tool for perception and generation\056 As tool\055calling\054 code execution\054 browser control\054 and computer\055use capabilities were layered on top\054 AI expanded from a system that generates answers into an actor that interacts with the outside world\05615\056 Since 2024\054 this trajectory has acquired a name\072 agentic AI\056 Agents now call tools\054 browse the web\054 evaluate transactions\054 and in some cases execute payments\056 McKinsey projects that agent\055based commerce could reach \0443 to \0445 trillion globally by 2030\05616\056 More important than the number itself is the behavioral shift it implies\056 An economy in which vast numbers of AI agents must access\054 request\054 evaluate\054 and pay for vast numbers of services cannot be managed by humans manually entering card details or administering subscriptions\056\n\nThe third force is stablecoins\056 Dollar\055pegged stablecoins \024 USDC issued by      \176)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 15577 0 R
     /Pg 3108 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
