  << /ActualText (KYC \050Know Your Customer\051 refers to the procedures financial institutions use to verify the identity of their clients\054 assess transaction purposes\054 and evaluate risk\056 It forms part of broader Anti\055Money Laundering \050AML\051 and counter\055terrorism financing frameworks\054 shaped by FATF international recommendations and embedded in national legislation\056)
