15667 0 obj
  << /ActualText (automation layered on top of identity\055based payment\056\n\nYet delegation alone is not enough to solve the payment problem of the machine economy\056 Automation designed within a specific platform like Alexa for Shopping can work in a controlled environment\054 but it breaks down when millions of agents need to simultaneously access millions of services\054 paying small amounts per API call or data request\056 Routing every payment through a human account and card authority\054 request by request\054 cannot sustain the speed and frequency the machine economy demands\056 What is needed is not smarter automation of existing identity\055based payment\054 but new payment infrastructure \024 one where payments can be executed at the level of individual requests\054 within budgets and policies set by humans\054 without having to loop back through human authorization each time\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 15668 0 R
