15680 0 obj
  << /ActualText (within\056 But the repetitive small\055value transactions that occur within those boundaries \024 API calls\054 data access\054 model usage\054 content access\054 compute costs \024 will increasingly be handled by agents through cryptographic signatures and automated settlement\056 The machine economy is not forming outside the human economy\073 it is more likely to take shape as a domain in which machines handle the speed and frequency of execution within a framework of responsibility and control set by humans\056\n\nOne point is critical here\072 key\055based payment does not mean the dissolution of accountability\056 The fact that an agent can execute a payment with a valid key does not mean responsibility for that payment transfers to the agent\056 A key proves the authority to execute \024 but the party that sets that authority\054 defines its limits\054 and bears responsibility for the outcomes remains the human user or legal entity\056 Key\055based payment systems are not a replacement for identity\055based regulation\073 they are closer to a mechanism for delegating and verifying individual executions under a framework of identity\055based accountability\056 Anti\055money laundering rules\054 KYC requirements\054 and tax obligations remain essential institutional foundations of the human economy \024 and as the machine economy grows\054 they will need to become more sophisticated\054 not less\056 What changes is not that responsible parties disappear\054 but how responsibility and execution are coupled\056 Regulation still designates humans or legal entities as the accountable parties\054 but the actual execution of individual payments can be delegated to agents within limits and conditions those parties set \024 and that delegated execution is verified through keys and signatures\056 When the payment gap that sat empty for thirty years is finally filled\054 what operates on top of it is not just a technical protocol\056 It is also an institutional order that reconfigures how accountability is assigned and how execution is delegated\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 15681 0 R
     /Pg 5010 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
