  << /ActualText (A facilitator in x402 is an infrastructure layer that intermediates payment verification and on\055chain settlement execution\054 allowing sellers to accept x402 payments without building their own blockchain integration or verification logic\056 The facilitator is not a custodian holding user funds \024 it is a relay layer that assists with verification and settlement\056)
