15925 0 obj
  << /ActualText (When Satoshi Nakamoto opened an access system based not on identity but on keys\054 not on permission but on protocol\054 that design also left the door open for actors that had not yet arrived\056 What we are witnessing in the machine economy is the first opening of that door\056\nWhat we choose to open that door to \024 and what we choose to protect it from \024 is the responsibility that falls to the designers of 2026\056 The technology has already arrived\056 What remains is deciding which institutions and infrastructures will govern it\056)
